data: {"id": "e59641cd3d97496f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1518", "run_id": "e59641cd3d97496f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "节点描述权限受限，但已有足够证据得出结论：\n\n## 最终证据总结\n\n### 实体\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-v06/workload`，UID `f0ed729b-e64a-4bd6-8065-3af3efc737f8`\n- **节点**: `node2` (10.2.0.50)\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`\n\n### 支持的因果链\n1. **`ContainerCreating` 的直接原因已明确**：HostPath volume `input` 挂载失败\n2. **事件原文**（持续 79 分钟，重复 45 次）：\n   ```\n   MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\": hostPath type check failed: /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input is not a directory\n   ```\n3. **Pod ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789131507955, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

