data: {"id": "e59641cd3d97496f-final", "run_id": "e59641cd3d97496f", "seq": 1523, "ts_ms": 1789131523342, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v06/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod挂载Volume 'input'失败：宿主机节点 node2 上 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 路径不是一个有效的目录（HostPath type check failed），导致容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` | 状态 `Pending`，Pod 阶段 `Pending`；Ready 状态为 `False` (`ContainersNotReady`) | 确定异常实体状态 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` | 容器 `app` 状态 `ContainerCreating`；重启计数 `0` | 明确容器卡在启动阶段，尚未进入运行期 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedMount`：HostPath type check failed: `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` is not a directory | 直接指出 Volume 挂载失败的根因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Timed out`：`unmounted volumes=[input]`，在 77-79 分钟内反复重试挂载 | 印证挂载失败是持续存在的阻塞状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 为 `1` (Label: `reason=ContainerCreating`) | 时序数据侧面印证 K8s 事件与 Pod 状态 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#3, #4）直接提供了失败机制，明确指出宿主机上的指定 HostPath 不是一个有效的目录；Pod 状态（#1, #2）和 Metric 数据（#5）一致表明容器因此原因处于持续等待（Waiting/Creating）状态，且无重启行为，符合挂载失败的特征。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n宿主机节点 node2 上 /var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input 路径不是有效目录 → HostPath Volume 类型校验失败 (FailedMount) → kubelet 阻塞 Pod 挂载 → 容器 `app` 进入 ContainerCreating 等待状态，Pod 整体处于 Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod `aiops-case-v06/workload` 使用的 HostPath Volume `input` 挂载失败。K8s 事件 `fact-928609b81005` 记录了明确的底层错误：节点上指定的路径 `/var/lib/aiops-fixture-unavailable-7f394bef/input` 不是一个有效的目录（HostPath type check failed）。这一状态导致容器无法完成初始化，Pod 一直停留在 `Pending` 状态，并在 79 分钟的重试窗口内持续阻塞。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v06/workload: 41.8s (Evidence 35.2s, RCA 6.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v06/workload**: pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 64.912, "metrics": {"run_id": "e59641cd3d97496f", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 64.91968870162964, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-sandbox-create-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 64919.68870162964, "llm_calls": 12, "llm_duration_ms": 61751.32131576538, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6736.520290374756, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2860.852003097534}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duratio